OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 12 MAY
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GSoweto spins a track from the UK
OL,12,     Gbased Australian trumpeter Audrey
OL,13,     GPowne and saxophonist Laura Misch
OL,14,     Gis back with another favourite
OL,15,     Grecord from her collection.
OL,16,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,17,     GChristian Tetzlaff performs
OL,18,     GBeethoven's Violin Concerto with
OL,19,     Gthe Orchestre de la Suisse
OL,20,     GRomande under conductor Daniele
OL,21,     GGatti. Beethoven's third symphony
OL,22,     Gcompletes the programme.
